			"notes": "**What's new in 0.2.74**\n\n- **Tall crops from resource packs fill their block on the map again.** Some packs build crops taller than a block and leave the top of the texture empty; tilted, the empty part used to squeeze the visible plant into half the block. Plants from the game look exactly as before.\n\nFor Minecraft 26.3 with Fabric Loader and Fabric API. The full map loads from servers with the [Heroic Map plugin](https://github.com/VonNekyia/heroic-map-renderer-plugin), or draws itself from the chunks you load.\n\n[Documentation](https://github.com/VonNekyia/heroic-map-renderer-mod/blob/v0.2.74/docs/index.md) · [All releases on GitHub](https://github.com/VonNekyia/heroic-map-renderer-mod/releases)\n\nPublisher and responsible: VonNekyia. Contact: contact@mcterranova.com\n\nNOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT PRODUCT. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT."
