			"notes": "**What's new in 0.2.73**\n\n- **Plants lean to the north on the minimap and your own map.** Crops, grass, flowers, kelp and seagrass now tilt 45° so you see them from the side instead of a flat patch of texture. Each plant stays inside its block, plants in water stay under the surface, and bamboo leaves and pumpkin and melon stems show too.\n\nFor Minecraft 26.3 with Fabric Loader and Fabric API. The full map loads from servers with the [Heroic Map plugin](https://github.com/VonNekyia/heroic-map-renderer-plugin), or draws itself from the chunks you load.\n\n[Documentation](https://github.com/VonNekyia/heroic-map-renderer-mod/blob/v0.2.73/docs/index.md) · [All releases on GitHub](https://github.com/VonNekyia/heroic-map-renderer-mod/releases)\n\nPublisher and responsible: VonNekyia. Contact: contact@mcterranova.com\n\nNOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT PRODUCT. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT."
